@yaichenbaum What do you think of exporting all settings in a .zip file? I've pushed a test branch [here](https://github.com/gave92/files-uwp/tree/issue_7032)  that imports/exports all settings to/from a zip file.
It includes: pinned items, user settings, file tags, terminal profiles, bundles. All settings are applied without restart.

